Custom DeepStream bounding-box parser for AIPV1EMI0001
=======================================================

Parses the output of the YOLOv7-tiny TensorRT engine (EfficientNMS_TRT node:
num_dets / det_boxes / det_scores / det_classes) into
NvDsInferObjectDetectionInfo for DeepStream's nvinfer (Triton backend).

Build
-----

Built automatically by bin/build.sh at the repository root:

    cd bin && ./build.sh

which runs `make` in this directory and copies the resulting
libnvds_infercustomparser.so into models/AIPV1EMI0001_Yolo_Detector/.

Requires the DeepStream headers and CUDA toolkit available in the station's
ms3_videostreaming / ms8_jupyter containers (CUDA_VER is passed by build.sh).

Usage
-----

Referenced from configs/config_infer_primary_detector_yolov7.txt:

    postprocess {
      detection {
        custom_parse_bbox_func: "NvDsInferParseCustomEfficientNMS"
      }
    }
    custom_lib {
      path: "../models/AIPV1EMI0001_Yolo_Detector/libnvds_infercustomparser.so"
    }
